Z||000036||Mach10||10-21-2001||05:51 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by JohnnyK:<BR><B>Yeah, so he did something you guys didn't appreciate, so now we have the typical PFF gang up here, where you all come off as pompous arrogant assholes. Because he did something someone didn't agree with, you guys have to start taking cheap shots and make fun of his website and crap? Jesus Christ</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Grinthock was WRONG. His is a small, nicely done signature. But it is ALSO a banner-link to his site. That is SPAM. Cliff asked him to remove it. He didn't immediately, and now here's all this "PFF gang war." <BR>He is trying to rationalize it by saying it's small. Cliff doesn't like it 'cos its an AD. I fail to see the argument, here...||||reg||3
